<title>UK: United Industries sells Holden Hydroman.</title>
<headline>United Industries sells Holden Hydroman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Industries Plc said on Wednesday it had sold its loss-making automotive plastics business to a company controlled by Polytec Kunststofftechnick GmbH for 4.7 million stg in cash.</p>
<p>The British engineering group said the sale of Holden Hydroman would enable it to focus on the development of its engineering plastics and springs divisions.</p>
<p>In the six months to June 30 1996,  Holden Hydroman recorded a loss of 588,000 stg on sales of 6.3 million.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
